      "reason": "Source uses the lowercase race adjective dwarven. Maintained bare Dwarven=ဒွာ့ဗန်, Dwarven District and dwarven paladins establish the same core; 1703 completion uses dwarven (ဒွာ့ဗန်) for the same identity. Capitalization does not create a new core. Reconcile only the phonetic ဒွာ့ဗင် to ဒွာ့ဗန်; recognizable English dwarven and all source meaning remain. Historical inconsistent compounds are not blanket canonical approval. This remains an assisted pronunciation proposal pending native review.",
