      "sourceEnglish": "Here it is, <name>. A weapon worthy of a champion of the Light such as yourself. I've named it after a great dwarven <class> who was a friend of mine. His name was Verigan... Bosch Verigan. Please take it on behalf of myself and my wife. We owe you a great debt, and the world will be a safer place with one of your skill traveling the land."
